{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_bpipe_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_bpipe_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "难行长路",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bpipe_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "fcc164702d8d0d62cfed471e1e16ed090ceedf25d4e728a9081de1e08c926838",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "风笛"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:41 P.M. 天气/阴\n龙门7区外 入城关口"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "星熊督察，你总算来啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "唉，我可是脱鞋脱了一半，就给你小子一通电讯叫出来，大晚上跑过大半个龙门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "——所以，你说的人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "咳，抓、抓住了！现在正关在临时监室里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "抓了？几个人抓的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "呃，就我和另一个执勤的兄弟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......你说的，那是个维多利亚士兵，手里还拿着挺吓人的兵器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "我也搞不懂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "我跟阿平还没走近，她就丢掉了武器，举着双手挥了老半天，嘴里还大声喊着“我在这里”，简直跟生怕我们看不见一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "督察，我在这关口当了几年差，真没见过这种偷渡客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "没事，我去会会她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哦，对了，你在电讯里说，她还喊了什么话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "她大炎官话讲得很差......但听起来似乎是，陈......陈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "搞不好是我听错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "啊......哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "行了，我有数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呜哇，好亮——咦，终于有人来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "嗯，来问几个问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是......审讯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，以前都是我审别人，突然换到被审问的位置上，还真不太习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "那你还乖乖交了武器......没想过逃出去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从这里出去应该还蛮简单的......就算不用破城矛也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳咳，不，我不是这个意思！我忘了你是在审我......呃，我没想过要跑啊，我是自愿在这待着的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "为什么？很少见人喜欢蹲大狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倒也不是想被关着啦。只是，我听说硬闯关口的话，会有警察来抓我......在龙门是叫近卫局对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就想找你们，所以用了个最快的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "找谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陈陈......我是说，陈。她是在近卫局吧？好像已经是......警司？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，好可惜，我本来还以为她得到消息会自己过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你和你说的这位陈警司有什么关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们是好朋友啊，她在维多利亚上学的时候，我们是同学。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哪所学校？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，皇家近卫学校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这么说，你是士官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......退役之前是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "一名维多利亚退役士官，身穿制服，夜闯另一个国家边境城市的入城关口，并且还拿着制式武器——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是去除了弹射功能的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......但保留着填弹装置，依然具有很强的爆破能力。没错吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）按照规定，我的确应该将破城矛上缴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这么说，你不是正常退役？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么快就被问出来了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，早知道会有这一天，我上讯问学理论课的时候就该更努力一点的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你很想隐瞒自己的退役过程？小姐，如果你是逃兵，我这就该打电话叫人来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，请别叫人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我真的退役了，我向你保证！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会试着解释一下，但是，有些信息我实在没法在这里透露。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "先说说看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好吧，事情是这样的。三个月前，我还在军队里，我们小队当时在追查一个案件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "查案过程......呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只能说，因为查这个案件，我们小队目前还活着......不，还能自由行动的，只剩下我一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "抱歉，这回忆一定很惨烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢你的理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不过，我有一点不明白。你连命都差点没了，那帮维多利亚军队的老头子不该给你颁上一堆奖章吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奖励？算啦，案子没查完，我从来没想过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但至少......我以为他们能多派些人来帮我继续追查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "结果没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很令人惊讶是不是？警官，我比你更想不明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一开始试着找了很多人。从半岛郡驻军开始，他们每一个都在安抚我，让我等待上级的命令，允诺我会尽快增派人手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听从指示，结果发现时间越耗越久，调查却全无进展。于是我决定绕开地方驻军，直接联络伦蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这个过程不算太容易，好在我之前积攒了一些怎么跟驻军打交道的经验，并且一路上总能遇上好心人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最后，我成功抵达了距离伦蒂尼姆最近的一处军营——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就是在那里，我做出了退役的决定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "因为他们还是没有帮你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "长官，伯爵，大公爵......他们可能有别的苦衷吧。反正他们这么跟我说，我全听进去了，直到那一天......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我无意中听见，中校在和另一个我不认识的军官谈论对我的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，我没想到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "距离事件发生过去整整三十七天，我没等来增援，只等来了一纸调令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你心里肯定很不好受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......我的心情很复杂。难过？还是失望，或者愤怒......我说不上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在得知这个消息的时候，我的脑子一片空白，唯一的念头是庆幸自己把破城矛放在了训练室，而不是带在手边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不然的话，你会动手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不会吧......大概。毕竟，我始终记得自己的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "同样的，作为一名维多利亚军人，我必须服从命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......警官，在那一刻，我发现我做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "没有一支军队能容忍抗拒命令的士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊。就这样，我很快想通了，我要在他们决定我的去向之前，自己离开军队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "他们答应放你走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "退役手续还算顺利啦，以前队长和陈陈都抱怨过我太倔，中校他们当然怎么劝阻都没用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，就在我去军营交还武器的时候，我遇到了袭击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......袭击？犯人是谁？你在追查的人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很有可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是没想过，他们为什么会选择在军营动手，明明之前一个多月都没有管我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "会不会是敌人最终还是渗透进了军队高层？又或者根本就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，这些都不重要了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我打退了其中几个，可他们人还是很多，我不得不拿着破城矛匆匆逃了出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "之后呢？你就这样逃出了维多利亚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说逃......也没错，哈哈，这一路真是挺狼狈的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道那群人很难缠，自然不敢回家，我不想让鬼魂也缠上妈妈他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "军队更是回不去了，找警察也只会给他们添麻烦，我想来想去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "只能找同学了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，是呀，陈陈答应过的，我有事没事都能来找她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，警官，你笑什么呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "没事。所以，你来了龙门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她确实是在龙门，我没搞错吧？去年年初的拜年电讯还是从这个地方发出来的呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "继续说说你为何要硬闯关口吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "无论有没有人在后头追杀，你好歹也是维多利亚公民，不至于连张正常的车票都买不起吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......还真买不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "啊？维多利亚职业军人的收入还不及龙门街头仔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个......我的钱包和护照都丢在莱塔尼亚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......我是不是该佩服你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——被炸得一点不剩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我确实该佩服你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不光钱包，我也差一点点就被炸飞啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那时候我才刚离开维多利亚，蹭了一支商队的车横穿莱塔尼亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚入境没两天，车子路过一座小城市，当地一位子爵挺热情地招待了我们，还安排我们住进了最好的酒店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到了傍晚的时候，其他人去赴宴了，我一个人待在分给我的豪华套间里，有服务员送了一份免费的晚餐过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我吃了几口，总觉得莱塔尼亚菜太精致了，我吃不太习惯，就想着出门找个农贸市场溜达几圈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......没想到才刚到楼下，轰隆一声，我房间的窗框就砸到了我跟前，而且整个都变了形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这炸得还真狠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是呀，就算是我，被从十几层高的房间里炸飞出来，也可能会没命吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......只是可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "已经很严重了呀！真没想到莱塔尼亚也这么水深火热。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "嗯，看来你从精神到身体都比那倒霉的窗框结实多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？多谢......夸奖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "说起来，你知道是谁要炸你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道啊。我加入商队没几天，有力出力，应该没什么仇家吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实......我也没那么在乎这一个问题的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自从开始查这个案子，谜团越来越多，就没有什么豁然开朗的时候，我都习惯啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "那么，你来龙门，是想让你朋友撑你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，我不需要别人保护，只是想问问陈陈愿不愿意帮我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哦？你还想着回维多利亚查案？哪怕这么多人要杀你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "还真一点犹豫都没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从维多利亚到龙门，我走了几个月。但凡我有半点犹豫，这条路我都走不下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我答应过，我要把真相带到所有人面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不知道真相在哪，我就去找——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "敌人不让我说话，我偏要说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#8",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "离开维多利亚，我没有回头。可要是哪天我做好了回去的准备，我更不会有一丝动摇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不怕吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "嗯，我信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "把不怕死挂在嘴边的战士，要么是在说大话，要么是还没想明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我相信你做好了该做的准备，也相信你没有说假话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这么说，你会帮我联络陈......陈警司？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "给，这袋子里有几只叉烧包。凉差不多了，将就一下还能吃。在荒地里赶了这么久路，你该饿坏了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "就算是像你这么强悍的瓦伊凡，该吃饭还得吃饭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......真好吃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#9",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，不对啊，这也是讯问流程？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "流程？早结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还以为你会问我一些我和陈陈过去的事，来验证我有没有说谎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "没必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "该知道的，我早知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，等等，我想起来了，我也知道你，你是近卫局的星......星......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "星......星？哈哈，最好还是别这么叫我，尤其是别在她们面前这么叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这样吧，风笛小姐，按照规矩，麻烦你再多在这屋待一会，我先出去一下，见个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "审完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "既然好奇，为什么不进来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......有什么值得好奇的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "罗德岛的人都在路上了，她在这里根本待不长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "算算时间，他们是该来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "哼，那条扑街龙，这阵子也不知道又在哪里逍遥，害我们在这里加班。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "要是老陈听说老同学千里迢迢找来，一点不着急是不可能的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "她虽然不说，但对朋友一向仗义，Missy，你又不是不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......她的朋友，关我什么事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "还有你，明明刚接到消息就第一时间给罗德岛发了信，为什么还要费这工夫审讯？唱黑脸很过瘾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "那么多小子看着呢，都是当差的人，流程还是要好好走完的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "再说了，你就不想打探打探，老陈之后可能会卷进什么新的危险里去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "......不想知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "唉，烦死了！等里面那家伙被罗德岛的人接走，你就给我好好汇报清楚......不许偷懒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哈哈，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma_ns_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "看，罗德岛的干员来领人了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸欸欸，什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "陈陈竟然已经不在龙门近卫局了，你们让我去一个别的地方等着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，那家公司叫什么来着......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风笛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——罗、德、岛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
